65,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"dongyuan-e-p013a-q","section":"chapter-006","block":"b-ddf84f37fefd9f568982","layer":"pei","quote":"﹝三﹞《英雄记》云：“苗，太后之同母兄。先嫁朱氏之子。进部曲将吴匡，素怨苗不与进同心，又疑其与宦官通谋。乃令军中曰：‘杀大将军者，车骑也！’遂引兵与卓弟旻，共攻杀苗于朱爵阙下。”","attribution":"《英雄记》","section_title":"董二袁刘传第六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0017.xhtml","index":52,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-3e8438a739c850644e39","start":0,"end":89,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"dongyuan-e-p018b-q","section":"chapter-006","block":"b-1ae91153ea1dde6bada4","layer":"pei","quote":"发何苗棺，出其尸，支解节，弃于道边。又收苗母舞阳君杀之，弃尸于苑枳落中，不复收敛。","attribution":"《英雄记》","section_title":"董二袁刘传第六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0017.xhtml","index":69,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-e8d7e6d5f5019f0c8057","start":38,"end":79,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"dongyuan-q-o005","section":"chapter-006","block":"b-ef2d794a3a83d523b5a3","layer":"original","quote":"卓未至，进败。﹝一﹞中常侍段珪等，劫帝走小平津〖4〗；卓遂将其众迎帝于北芒〖5〗，还宫。﹝二﹞时进弟车骑将军苗，为进众所杀〖6〗。﹝三﹞进、苗部曲无所属〖7〗，皆诣卓；卓又使吕布杀执金吾丁原〖8〗，并其众：故京都兵权唯在卓。﹝四﹞","section_title":"董二袁刘传第六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0017.xhtml","index":27,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":115,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"dongyuan-q-p013","section":"chapter-006","block":"b-ddf84f37fefd9f568982","layer":"pei","quote":"﹝三﹞《英雄记》云：“苗，太后之同母兄。先嫁朱氏之子。进部曲将吴匡，素怨苗不与进同心，又疑其与宦官通谋。乃令军中曰：‘杀大将军者，车骑也！’遂引兵与卓弟旻，共攻杀苗于朱爵阙下。”","attribution":"《英雄记》","section_title":"董二袁刘传第六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0017.xhtml","index":52,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-3e8438a739c850644e39","start":0,"end":89,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"dongyuan-q-p018","section":"chapter-006","block":"b-1ae91153ea1dde6bada4","layer":"pei","quote":"《英雄记》曰：“卓欲震威。侍御史扰龙宗诣卓白事，不解剑；立挝杀之，京师震动。发何苗棺，出其尸，支解节，弃于道边。又收苗母舞阳君杀之，弃尸于苑枳落中，不复收敛。”","attribution":"《英雄记》","section_title":"董二袁刘传第六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0017.xhtml","index":69,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-e8d7e6d5f5019f0c8057","start":0,"end":80,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"huanchen-q-70da4aa60d9bdc1806f9","section":"chapter-022","block":"b-a8cd43f2cc0b2f54b12a","layer":"pei","quote":"为车骑将军何苗所辟，司徒杨彪再加旌命","attribution":"裴注·《先贤行状》","section_title":"桓二陈徐卫卢传第二十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0050.xhtml","index":443,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-aadc6edeb8d5e1786123","start":41,"end":59,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"mantian-q-70fba0a03821ef1ea19d","section":"chapter-026","block":"b-4786a3d67b02098d83da","layer":"original","quote":"值京都乱，苗、隐见害","section_title":"满田牵郭传第二十六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0058.xhtml","index":198,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":50,"end":60,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
